# Ignore everything by default, whitelist what images actually need
*
!requirements/
!requirements/**
!src/
!src/**
!configs/
!configs/**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!Makefile

# Never bake secrets or local artifacts into image layers
**/.env*
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/wandb/
**/data/
**/training/
**/eval/
**/release/
**/htmlcov/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
